{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving Princess of Mars</strong> is an stylish action platformer featuring puzzles to solve and ton of enemies to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Our main protagonist is lumberjack Jack from Earth who surprisingly spawns on Mars where he's trying to save its princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted levels:</strong> Each level is uniquely designed for countless methods of completion. Defeat strange Martian enemies using spontaneous approaches and eliminate them on your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional combat:</strong>\u00a0Adapt to chaos with style: stomp enemies like you're squashing grapes at a festival, deliver kicks that would make a martial arts movie jealous, and turn every encounter into a slapstick ballet of traps and tumbles. No bullets, no mercy\u2014just airborne justice and foot-powered fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple controllable characters</strong>: You will be able to switch between different characters during the gameplay. All controllable characters have different abilities, but of course \u2013 our main hero is the strongest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unconventional Storytelling:</strong> A mysterious tale unfolds through cinematic sequences \u2014 like a movie that forgot it was a game, took a wrong turn at plot twist junction, and crash-landed into a finale so unexpected it might just file a complaint with reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help Jack save the Princess of Mars... and maybe the entire planet of Mars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.poster.avif?t=1760961426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.webm?t=1760961426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.mp4?t=1760961426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange Martian enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u00a0playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 engaging large platformer levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlockable Hard difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >humoristic comments from characters during conversations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.poster.avif?t=1760961426\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.webm?t=1760961426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.mp4?t=1760961426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at last, this game also raises many questions... and some of those are even answers...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there life on Mars?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it look like (life on Mars)?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What help can you get from Prof. One-Rock?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936890?t=1760961426","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/8f026f57d3da2a5773c7d74e0f38198986a49cad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760961426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/49d0ec02c8b53d477895561310704caef595ea4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760961426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/49d0ec02c8b53d477895561310704caef595ea4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760961426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving Princess of Mars</strong> is an stylish action platformer featuring puzzles to solve and ton of enemies to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Our main protagonist is lumberjack Jack from Earth who surprisingly spawns on Mars where he's trying to save its princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted levels:</strong> Each level is uniquely designed for countless methods of completion. Defeat strange Martian enemies using spontaneous approaches and eliminate them on your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional co